It is raining heavily outside.
There is also a strong wind.
My umbrella is very small.
So I look for an auto.
Suddenly an auto comes.
I hail the auto.
The driver stops the auto.
"To Panampilly Nagar," I say.
"Please get in," the driver says.
I get into the auto quickly.
Now I am safe.
Kochi's weather changes quickly.
In the morning, it is very sunny.
In the afternoon, it is very hot.
But now it is raining heavily.
The app says it will rain at night too.
The road is entirely full of water now.
The auto goes slowly through the water.
I sit looking at the rain outside.
